  "Change the password for a local administrator account.\n\nIf no local administrator has been configured yet, this\noption lets you set up an initial admin or root account.\n\nNote: changing a password will disable two-factor\nauthentication for that account.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Verander die wagwoord vir 'n plaaslike administrateur rekening.\n\nAs geen plaaslike administrateur nog gekonfigureer is nie, dit\nopsie laat jou 'n aanvanklike administrateur of wortelrekening opstel.\n\nLet wel: die verandering van 'n wagwoord sal twee-faktor deaktiveer\nstawing vir daardie rekening."
  },
