  "Configure global network settings:\n\n  • Hostname and domain\n  • Default IPv4 and IPv6 gateways\n  • DNS nameservers (up to three)\n\nChanges take effect immediately after saving.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Stel globale netwerkinstellings op:\n\n  • Gasheernaam en domein\n  • Verstek IPv4- en IPv6-poorte\n  • DNS-naambedieners (tot drie)\n\nVeranderinge tree onmiddellik in werking nadat dit gestoor is."
