  },
  "Configure networking for this TrueNAS system.\n\n  • Interface settings  – DHCP, IP aliases, MTU\n  • Network settings    – Hostname, domain, gateways, DNS\n  • Static routes       – Add and remove static routes\n\nChanges to interfaces require a commit step\nbefore they take effect.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Stel netwerk vir hierdie TrueNAS-stelsel op.\n\n  • Interface-instellings – DHCP, IP-aliasse, MTU\n  • Netwerkinstellings – Gasheernaam, domein, poorte, DNS\n  • Statiese roetes – Voeg statiese roetes by en verwyder dit\n\nVeranderinge aan koppelvlakke vereis 'n commit-stap\nvoordat hulle in werking tree."
  },
