  "Customise the TrueNAS TUI for your user account.\n\n  • Theme: default (blue), dark (green), high-contrast\n  • Startup view: system info pane or menu description\n  • Confirm dangerous actions (reboot, shutdown, reset)\n  • Language and date/time display formats\n\nSettings are saved to your account and persist across\nsessions on any client.": {
    "machine_translated": true,
    "translation": "Pas die TrueNAS TUI vir jou gebruikersrekening aan.\n\n  • Tema: verstek (blou), donker (groen), hoë kontras\n  • Opstartaansig: stelselinligtingpaneel of kieslysbeskrywing\n  • Bevestig gevaarlike handelinge (herlaai, afskakel, herstel)\n  • Taal en datum/tyd vertoon formate\n\nInstellings word in jou rekening gestoor en bly oor\nsessies op enige kliënt."
